<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_pruned_first">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Harnessing Synthetic Preference Data for Enhancing 
<br class="ltx_break">Temporal Understanding of Video-LLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
